{"4957250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rad New World", "steam_appid": 4957250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rad New World ☢️ – Post-Apocalyptic Open World RPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a brutal, beautiful wasteland where survival meets style in this retro-inspired post-apocalyptic CRPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957250/extras/606345f94395a65c82bd45385b914d04.avif?t=1788297358\" width=800 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rad New World blends gritty grunge/punk aesthetics with classic Western vibes as you step into the boots of a lone wanderer exploring a vast, unforgiving open world packed with danger, opportunity, and high replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own legend with deep character creation and a rich perk system that shapes your playstyle. Whether you’re a smooth-talking trader, a heavy-weapons specialist, or a stealthy lockpicker, every choice matters in this radioactive frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957250/extras/c4b70d4f0fa2959cc7e069a0f60fd28a.avif?t=1788297358\" width=800 height=272 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive Open World – Roam a wasteland filled with hidden ruins, dangerous factions, and strange encounters. Use the classic world map for strategic travel and random events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Combat – Master Unarmed, Melee, Throwing, and a full arsenal of Small, Medium, and Heavy weapons. Tactical positioning, crouching, crawling, and dynamic movement keep every fight intense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep RPG Systems – Level up, select powerful perks, manage buffs and debuffs (radiation, addiction, injuries, and more), and make meaningful dialogue choices that influence quests and factions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival &amp; Exploration – Lockpick your way into secured buildings, barter with shady merchants, loot valuable gear, and craft essential items. Drive vehicles across the wastes with a mobile inventory system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambling &amp; Risk – Test your luck with Poker, Dice, Slot machines, arena bets, and cheating mechanics for high-reward gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth Movement &amp; Immersion – Walk, run, crouch, climb, crawl, and drive through a living world that rewards exploration and clever tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;-This little project is something I've been tinkering with for a while now. — it's basically my love letter to some of my all-time favorite games: Fallout 1,2 &amp; Tactics.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Friends, the incredible support and excitement you’ve shown on social media has been overwhelming.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-So many of you asked for an earlier release that I decided the best path forward is Early Access. This lets me incorporate your direct feedback and ideas while continuing development. Your input will directly shape the final game!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cheers!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rad New World ☢️ – Post-Apocalyptic Open World RPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a brutal, beautiful wasteland where survival meets style in this retro-inspired post-apocalyptic CRPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957250/extras/606345f94395a65c82bd45385b914d04.avif?t=1788297358\" width=800 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rad New World blends gritty grunge/punk aesthetics with classic Western vibes as you step into the boots of a lone wanderer exploring a vast, unforgiving open world packed with danger, opportunity, and high replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own legend with deep character creation and a rich perk system that shapes your playstyle. Whether you’re a smooth-talking trader, a heavy-weapons specialist, or a stealthy lockpicker, every choice matters in this radioactive frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957250/extras/c4b70d4f0fa2959cc7e069a0f60fd28a.avif?t=1788297358\" width=800 height=272 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive Open World – Roam a wasteland filled with hidden ruins, dangerous factions, and strange encounters. Use the classic world map for strategic travel and random events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Combat – Master Unarmed, Melee, Throwing, and a full arsenal of Small, Medium, and Heavy weapons. Tactical positioning, crouching, crawling, and dynamic movement keep every fight intense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep RPG Systems – Level up, select powerful perks, manage buffs and debuffs (radiation, addiction, injuries, and more), and make meaningful dialogue choices that influence quests and factions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival &amp; Exploration – Lockpick your way into secured buildings, barter with shady merchants, loot valuable gear, and craft essential items. Drive vehicles across the wastes with a mobile inventory system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambling &amp; Risk – Test your luck with Poker, Dice, Slot machines, arena bets, and cheating mechanics for high-reward gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth Movement &amp; Immersion – Walk, run, crouch, climb, crawl, and drive through a living world that rewards exploration and clever tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;-This little project is something I've been tinkering with for a while now. — it's basically my love letter to some of my all-time favorite games: Fallout 1,2 &amp; Tactics.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Friends, the incredible support and excitement you’ve shown on social media has been overwhelming.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-So many of you asked for an earlier release that I decided the best path forward is Early Access. This lets me incorporate your direct feedback and ideas while continuing development. Your input will directly shape the final game!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cheers!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Survive as a lone wanderer in a post-apocalyptic open-world CRPG inspired by classic Fallout. Create your character, level up perks, explore the wasteland, fight with melee and guns, lockpick, barter, and gamble your way through the ruins.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957250/aa32116863f65701a1cba112842ac36ebe528672/header.jpg?t=1788297358", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957250/b86f359e30000296fa97a1b8e4adb3d2e285d545/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788297358", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957250/b86f359e30000296fa97a1b8e4adb3d2e285d545/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788297358", "website": "https://88mmgames.wixsite.com/welcome", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br>